  "title": "Galla Placidia",
  "summary": "Daughter of the Roman emperor Theodosius I and half-sister of Honorius. Alaric took her hostage during the Gothic sack of Rome in 410. She married the Gothic king Athaulf and later the general Constantius, and after 425 ruled as regent for her young son Valentinian III. She built and decorated churches, including in Ravenna, and died in 450.",
